---

<MainLayout title="The Archives | BlueRobin" description="The Archives — a self-hosted team of AI agents for your documents: specialists for retrieval, finance, health, and tax, backed by a triage agent, ensemble entity extraction, and a knowledge graph, all running on homelab Kubernetes.">
  <!-- Breadcrumb back to chooser -->
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-6"><a href="/" class="text-sm text-slate-600 hover:text-neural-400 transition-colors">← All projects</a></div>

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden" style="background: var(--gradient-mesh-light);">
    <!-- Animated background elements -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute -top-40 -right-40 w-96 h-96 bg-neural-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl animate-pulse"></div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-40 -left-40 w-96 h-96 bg-complement-500/8 rounded-full blur-3xl animate-pulse" style="animation-delay: 1s;"></div>
      <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-complement-500/6 rounded-full blur-3xl animate-pulse" style="animation-delay: 2s;"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20 sm:py-28">
      <!-- Hero Text -->
      <div class="text-center animate-entry">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium mb-8" style="background: var(--color-neural-alpha-10); border: 1px solid var(--color-neural-alpha-20); color: var(--color-neural-400);">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><circle cx="5" cy="6" r="2"/><circle cx="19" cy="6" r="2"/><circle cx="5" cy="18" r="2"/><circle cx="19" cy="18" r="2"/><path d="M6.5 7.5 10 10M17.5 7.5 14 10M6.5 16.5 10 14M17.5 16.5 14 14"/></svg>
          Homelab project &middot; The Archives &middot; Multi-Agent Document AI
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-display font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6 leading-tight tracking-tight">
          <span class="title-blue">A self-hosted team of AI agents<br>for your documents</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-5">
          Upload any document. Ask any question.<br>
          Get answers cited directly from your own archive.
        </p>

        <p class="text-base text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
          A homelab project &mdash; not one model, but a collection of agents. A triage agent reads and routes every upload; specialists for retrieval, finance, health, and tax do the work; an entity &amp; knowledge-graph agent connects it all. The deep stack &mdash; OCR, ensemble entity extraction, multi-model vector search, a graph database &mdash; is the toolbox they reach for. All on self-hosted Kubernetes.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mb-14">
          <a href="/articles/" class="btn-primary">
            Browse the Archives
          </a>
          <a href="/architecture/" class="btn-secondary">
            Architecture
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- Stats strip -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-8 gap-y-3 text-sm">
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full shrink-0 bg-complement-400"></span>
            Specialist Agents
          </span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full shrink-0 bg-complement-400"></span>
            Knowledge Graph
          </span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full shrink-0 bg-neural-500"></span>
            Per-User Encryption
          </span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-600">
