          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1.5">Triage agent &mdash; parse &amp; route</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Docling converts uploaded documents to structured text, preserving tables, headings, and layout. The triage agent classifies the domain and hands the document to the right specialist — the structure also drives accurate chunking during indexing.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto pt-1">
            <span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full" style="background: var(--color-neural-alpha-12); color: var(--color-neural-400); border: 1px solid var(--color-neural-alpha-20);">Docling OCR</span>
            <span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full" style="background: var(--color-neural-alpha-12); color: var(--color-neural-400); border: 1px solid var(--color-neural-alpha-20);">Structure Extraction</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2 -->
        <div class="glass-card p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 relative z-10">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold text-white shrink-0" style="background: var(--gradient-glow);">2</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-1.5">Specialists &amp; entity agent &mdash; extract &amp; index</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Domain specialists pull structured data (transactions, biomarkers, tax figures); the entity agent extracts and links named entities into a knowledge graph. Each chunk is embedded across 8 vector models and stored in Qdrant, alongside a generated summary and keyword set.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-auto pt-1">
            <span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full" style="background: var(--color-glow-alpha-10); color: var(--color-glow-500); border: 1px solid var(--color-glow-alpha-20);">Entity Extraction</span>
            <span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full" style="background: var(--color-glow-alpha-10); color: var(--color-glow-500); border: 1px solid var(--color-glow-alpha-20);">Knowledge Graph</span>
            <span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full" style="background: var(--color-glow-alpha-10); color: var(--color-glow-500); border: 1px solid var(--color-glow-alpha-20);">Embeddings</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3 -->
