            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">The retrieval agent fuses scores from all vector models with Reciprocal Rank Fusion and traverses the graph to find the most relevant passages. A locally hosted LLM answers in plain English, with citations to the exact source paragraphs.</p>
