            <div class="flex-1 h-px" style="background: var(--color-glow-alpha-20);"></div>
          </div>

          <!-- Row: Generated query -->
          <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden" style="background: #0a1119; border: 1px solid var(--color-glow-alpha-20);">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2" style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-glow-alpha-20);">
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full" style="background: oklch(66% 0.21 43);"></span>
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full" style="background: oklch(80% 0.18 80);"></span>
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full" style="background: oklch(69% 0.235 232);"></span>
              <span class="ml-2 text-[11px] font-mono" style="color: rgba(203,225,255,0.55);">retrieval-agent &middot; generated graph traversal + vector recall</span>
            </div>
            <pre class="px-4 py-3 text-[11.5px] leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto" style="font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; color: #cdddf2;"><span style="color: oklch(75% 0.17 70);">MATCH</span> (dr:<span style="color: oklch(78% 0.16 43);">Doctor</span> {name:<span style="color: oklch(82% 0.14 232);">"Dr. Nguyen"</span>})-[:<span style="color: oklch(80% 0.13 43);">DIAGNOSED</span>]-&gt;(dx:<span style="color: oklch(78% 0.16 43);">Diagnosis</span>)
<span style="color: oklch(75% 0.17 70);">MATCH</span> (dx)-[:<span style="color: oklch(80% 0.13 43);">TREATED_BY</span>]-&gt;(rx:<span style="color: oklch(78% 0.16 43);">Prescription</span>)
<span style="color: oklch(75% 0.17 70);">OPTIONAL MATCH</span> (lab:<span style="color: oklch(78% 0.16 43);">LabValue</span> {code:<span style="color: oklch(82% 0.14 232);">"HbA1c"</span>})-[:<span style="color: oklch(80% 0.13 43);">INFORMS</span>]-&gt;(dx)
<span style="color: oklch(75% 0.17 70);">WHERE</span> dx.date &gt;= $since        <span style="color: rgba(203,225,255,0.4);">// "since my diagnosis"</span>
<span style="color: oklch(75% 0.17 70);">RETURN</span> rx.drug, rx.dose, dx.name, lab.value, dr.name
<span style="color: oklch(85% 0.14 80);">&#8869; hybrid</span>  RRF( vector_topk(q_embed, k=8), graph_paths )   <span style="color: rgba(203,225,255,0.4);">// Qdrant + graph fusion</span></pre>
          </div>

          <!-- Row: The answer -->
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start gap-4">
            <div class="shrink-0 w-28 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-600 pt-2">You ask</div>
            <div class="flex-1">
              <div class="rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800 mb-3" style="background: var(--color-glow-alpha-10); border: 1px solid var(--color-glow-alpha-20);">
                &ldquo;What has Dr. Nguyen prescribed since my diagnosis, and why?&rdquo;
              </div>
              <div class="rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed" style="background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); border: 1px solid var(--color-neural-alpha-25);">
                <span class="font-medium" style="color: var(--color-neural-400);">BlueRobin:</span> Based on your medical letter (Jan 2024) and prescription (Apr 2024), Dr. Nguyen prescribed Lisinopril 10mg following a diagnosis of stage-1 hypertension. The decision was informed by the HbA1c reading of 7.2 from your March lab results, which indicated elevated cardiovascular risk.
                <div class="flex gap-2 mt-2.5 flex-wrap">
                  <span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded" style="background: var(--color-complement-alpha-10); color: var(--color-complement-500); border: 1px solid var(--color-complement-alpha-20);">Cited: medical-letter-jan-2024.pdf</span>
                  <span class="text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded" style="background: var(--color-complement-alpha-10); color: var(--color-complement-500); border: 1px solid var(--color-complement-alpha-20);">Cited: lab-results-mar-2024.pdf</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-center text-sm text-slate-600 mt-6">This is not keyword search. The entity agent connected three documents. The retrieval agent reasoned across them.</p>
